This script processes and analyzes agricultural yield data to compute a weighted yield gap index, integrating information on crops, harvested areas, and yield gaps by country and year. 
The calculations account for the proportion of each crop's harvested area within the total area, enabling the generation of national and temporal statistics.
Not all crops contribute equally to a country's agricultural output. Using harvested area as a weight emphasizes the crops that dominate the landscape.
The weighted yield gap provides a single value per country and year, summarizing the combined impact of yield gaps across all crops.
